      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "If the \"Make Avatar Public\" is made Orange, what color should \"Make Avatar Private\" have? \n\nI think that only moving the button, and leaving color alone should be enough. If people still somehow mis-click the option to make an avatar public, it's quite likely they'll quickly notice as the button color will change",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
