      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This suggestion still seems somewhat awkward.\n\nIf you do it close to a \"Delete\" button: Having confirmation on both \"Delete\" and \"Make Public\" while they are so close to each other might make someone accidentally delete their avatar one day as well - because both give you the prompt and people eventually will just get used to pressing \"yes\" on a confirmation.\n\nalso: Orange color to me feels more like applying a \"limitation/restriction\" as opposed to making it \"Public/Available\".",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
