      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Unfortunate to have seen this reverted on the website at some point. The same issues of \"Make Avatar Public\" raised in the OP are also a risk in the SDK: https://feedback.vrchat.com/sdk-bug-reports/p/the-content-manager-tab-in-sdk-has-a-footgun-make-public-has-no-confirmation-pro",
